formal land tenure:It's a Partially,The Land Book is now available online. The Cadastre is supposed to be online but the link was not working at the time of this assessment. The Ministry of Construction, Housing, and Urban Planning is rolling out in 2024 a new online referencing system of Unique Land Identifiers (IDUFCIs). The Integrated Urban Land Management System (Sigfu) website has a map of land subdivisions that is planned to include these IDUFCIs. Definitive concession orders issued between 1996 and 2024 can be found in the legal database maintained by the Direction of Financial Control. Mining and oil permits are online.;
