informal land parcels:It's a Partially,The government has information on informal land subdivisions in Abidjan as it has started a vast operation to formalize identified informal land subdivisions, but it is not available online;
leasehold/concession rights:It's a Partially,Definitive concession rights attributed on state-owned land are published online, but not in the form of a register. They are published individually in legal databases

